{"id":"菲亚","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"菲亚","aliases":[],"warnings":[],"status":"approved","available_eras":["mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"菲亚是凯瑟琳偶然发掘的存在，拥有极罕见的高神力亲和体质，是目前唯一能在常态下稳定承载星神意识的载体。在涉及神祇干涉的危机中，她被征用为「降神」的核心媒介，凭借肉身建立神明与现世对话的稳定链路。\n菲亚没有任何战斗能力。作为不可复制的战略资源，她处于多位神祇的联合监控与保护之下，任何针对她的敌意行为等同于对整个神系的宣战。","era_states":{"mainline":"与柯赛特形成反差，菲亚在亲密事宜上尚显稚嫩。这种经验的匮乏引发访客的保护欲，使她成为被悉心关照的对象。\n菲亚褐色长发，面无表情、声音平淡，面对血腥场面毫无情绪波动。她受养母之托送信给迪，后在咖啡厅二楼当看板娘，对雷恩有隐晦依恋。\n三无少女，总无表情，声音平淡听不出情绪；有自主意志，不接受“保护=隔离”，想“入世”帮大家；被迪老板当作罗塞的影子供养在神坛上，什么都不产出；主动申请加入二楼轮值，用“投名状”说服迪老板；由迪老板“带下来”，事后结论是“并不讨厌”；“罗塞守则”更新，不再不可触碰（有限度）；被伊尔教当作“容器/圣少女/素体”掳走。\n无表情/面瘫；清冷；呆萌（阿卡离开后）；爱吃甜食；吃曲奇/布丁；被恶魔教主用道具强行召唤阿卡附身；是阿卡高契合度的容器；同意借身体给阿卡；与雷恩有亲密关系；昏睡数天后苏醒，无附身后遗症（除更爱吃甜食）。\n温柔、会抚慰他人；无战斗力；咖啡厅服务员，是阿卡降临的容器；阿卡使用其身体时不保留记忆。\n平时带腹黑微笑；依赖雷恩；会开车；难得开玩笑；作为阿卡降临的凭依，后康复；跟随阿卡前往赫尔帝国。\n体能差、弱不禁风；心疼柯赛特，会主动要求放自己下来自己跑；与柯赛特、阿卡在帝国调查教廷真相，遭闪光骑士团追杀。\n面瘫/淡然，表情一如既往的淡然；默默关心同伴，不声不响地安慰柯赛特；眼神清明平静，能严谨分析战况；拥有罕见的「降神体质」，可随时作为容器让阿托兰等神降临；被阿托兰附身传达委托；一路激烈战斗「衣服都没脏」；与雷恩有亲密关系，作为神力生产基地成员。\n是优质的神降容器，常有神借用其身体传话；语气平淡，人偶般，但会配合补刀；先后被阿托兰、艾拉借用身体；参与瓦利诺决战，用干扰装置切断拉提斯神力回路。\n淡然、古井无波，被附身后毫无惊讶迷茫；对艾拉（那位大人）的意志完全顺从接受，不追问缘由；会淡淡补刀吐槽；体质特殊，是神力的敏感接收器；被艾拉借用身体逛街一整天；作为必要人物随队调查尸鬼；被希塔恩当面抓走（实际带走的是艾拉）。\n淡定，被艾拉附身；作为星神降临容器被囚于黑塔祭坛，被柯赛特救出；与柯赛特成婚。","afterstory":"访客们对观测菲亚与柯赛特之间的亲密互动抱有热忱。两人对此并无避讳，常在公共场合进行亲昵接触，将其视为自然的常态。\n清冷、面无表情；逻辑直球（常自说自话加戏）；会戏谑雷恩；速度极快（瞬移）；与柯赛特结婚；女仆装布料因艾拉要求而增加。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_00310","statement":"菲亚在涉及神祇干涉的危机中被征用为「降神」的核心媒介。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目52（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00311","statement":"菲亚战斗能力较弱，主要承担降神媒介与支援角色。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「后日谈开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目52（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00312","statement":"菲亚处于多位神祇的联合监控与保护之下。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「后日谈开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目52（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00313","statement":"菲亚是凯瑟琳发掘的存在。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目52（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00314","statement":"菲亚与柯赛特是伴侣关系，常在公共场合进行亲昵接触。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「阿尔卡特洛帝国覆灭之后」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目52（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00315","statement":"菲亚褐色长发，面无表情、眼神无神、声音平淡。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第24章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00316","statement":"菲亚面对血腥暴力场面毫不害怕，毫无情绪波动。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第24章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00317","statement":"菲亚受养母之托，送一封带特殊标志的信给迪。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第24章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00318","statement":"菲亚在咖啡厅二楼当看板娘，被熟客视为禁止试探的冰山美人。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第29章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00319","statement":"菲亚主动关心雷恩，指出其曲奇糖分超标并特调黑咖啡","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第29章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00320","statement":"总无表情，声音平淡听不出情绪，是“三无少女”","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第32章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00321","statement":"被迪老板当作罗塞的影子或象征供养在神坛上，什么都不产出，感到“无用”和“羞耻”","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第32章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00322","statement":"有自主意志，不接受“保护=隔离”，想“入世”帮大家","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第32"},{"fact_id":"fact_00323","statement":"主动申请加入二楼轮值表，用解衣的“投名状”说服迪老板","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第32章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00324","statement":"由迪老板“带下来”，事后结论是“并不讨厌”","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第32章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00325","statement":"“罗塞守则”更新：菲亚不再不可触碰，但仅限拥抱、亲吻与温和交流，禁止过激行为","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第32章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00326","statement":"她的存在变成“宁静”的稀缺资源，包容客人的秘密与软弱","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第32章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00327","statement":"被伊尔教称为“容器/圣少女/素体”，要献给破坏神阿卡","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位39"},{"fact_id":"fact_00328","statement":"对海拉姐姐们的互动“无所谓”“不介意”","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第36章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00329","statement":"菲亚无表情","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第041"},{"fact_id":"fact_00330","statement":"菲亚清冷","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第046"},{"fact_id":"fact_00331","statement":"菲亚呆萌","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第048"},{"fact_id":"fact_00332","statement":"爱吃甜食（被附身后变得比以前更爱吃甜食）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第44章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00333","statement":"菲亚吃甜食（曲奇）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第044"},{"fact_id":"fact_00334","statement":"被恶魔教主用道具强行召唤阿卡附身","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第041"},{"fact_id":"fact_00335","statement":"是阿卡难得契合度高的容器，本人也同意借身体给阿卡","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第46章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00336","statement":"与雷恩有亲密关系","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00337","statement":"附身后昏睡数天苏醒，无后遗症，只是更爱吃甜食","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第44章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00338","statement":"以能帮阿卡做实验的形式感到开心","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「阿卡破开海拉防御」","visibility":null,"source":"第58章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00339","statement":"菲亚是凯瑟琳的养女。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13"},{"fact_id":"fact_00340","statement":"菲亚平时带腹黑微笑","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位61"},{"fact_id":"fact_00341","statement":"菲亚作为阿卡降临的凭依，用仅存神力锁住众人生命力并修复脏器","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位66"},{"fact_id":"fact_00342","statement":"菲亚跟随阿卡前往赫尔帝国","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第69章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00343","statement":"菲亚体能差、弱不禁风，跑两步就喘","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位78"},{"fact_id":"fact_00344","statement":"菲亚心疼柯赛特，主动要求放自己下来自己跑","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位78"},{"fact_id":"fact_00345","statement":"菲亚拒绝了雷恩让她「帮忙」的提议（「我不干」）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位80"},{"fact_id":"fact_00346","statement":"菲亚红着眼眶默默走到柯赛特身边，轻轻拍她后背安慰","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_00347","statement":"菲亚表情一如既往的淡然（面瘫），不打招呼便推门而入","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位82"},{"fact_id":"fact_00348","statement":"菲亚拥有极为罕见的「降神体质」，可作为容器让阿托兰或其他神降临现世，是瓦利诺之行的最后保险","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「瓦利诺事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第89章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00349","statement":"菲亚一路以来的激烈战斗是唯二「衣服都没脏」的人之一","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「辛西娅死亡与艾琳娜复活阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位84"},{"fact_id":"fact_00350","statement":"菲亚眼神清明平静，一边扣衬衫扣子一边严谨分析「补给」能维持护盾系统全功率运转三天","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第89章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00351","statement":"优质神降容器，有神借她传话已是稀松平常","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「瓦利诺事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位97"},{"fact_id":"fact_00352","statement":"用最平淡的语气说着最糟糕的台词（补刀）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺王宫决战」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位98"},{"fact_id":"fact_00353","statement":"被阿托兰借用身体，后被艾拉借用身体下达委托（第97、99章）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位93"},{"fact_id":"fact_00354","statement":"战斗中持干扰装置，如手术刀般切断拉提斯神力回路","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺王宫决战」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位98"},{"fact_id":"fact_00355","statement":"菲亚对「那位大人」（艾拉）的意志只说「没那个必要，既然是那位大人的意志，我只需要接受就好」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位101"},{"fact_id":"fact_00356","statement":"菲亚体质特殊，是神力的敏感接收器，能替艾拉传话「不要担心，没有人会死」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「圣嘉尔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位106"},{"fact_id":"fact_00357","statement":"菲亚被艾拉附身后双眼失去焦距、变成纯粹白光，淡淡地跟希塔恩走","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「艾拉借菲亚身体被希塔恩带走」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位107"},{"fact_id":"fact_00358","statement":"作为星神艾拉的附身容器被囚于黑塔祭坛抽取权能","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「艾拉借菲亚身体被希塔恩带走」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位111"},{"fact_id":"fact_00359","statement":"与柯赛特在咖啡厅共同忙碌，是柯赛特最重要的人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位112"},{"fact_id":"fact_00360","statement":"被柯赛特突破「神之御座」结界救出","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「艾拉获救」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位112"},{"fact_id":"fact_00361","statement":"与柯赛特成婚，婚礼上表情淡定得像端咖啡","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「神战数月后的双婚礼」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位116"},{"fact_id":"fact_00362","statement":"淡定，认为被闹洞房是「祝福的最高形式」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「神战数月后的双婚礼」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位116"},{"fact_id":"fact_00363","statement":"菲亚在雷恩咖啡厅当服务员/咖啡师","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「后日谈开端」起","visibility":n